---
title: Disclaimer
description: GGE Command is not affiliated with Goodgame Studios. Using a bot breaks the game's rules and can get an account banned. Read what that means for you.
---

The short version: GGE Command is an independent product, using it is against the game's rules, and you take the risk.

## Not affiliated with Goodgame Studios {% #not-affiliated %}

GGE Command is an independent product run by Neise Solutions. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Goodgame Studios.

Goodgame Empire is a trademark of Goodgame Studios. The names of the game's events, units and features belong to their owners. These docs use them only to say what GGE Command works with.

## Using a bot breaks the game's rules {% #game-rules %}

The rules of Goodgame Empire do not allow bots. Goodgame Studios can ban a {% term id="game-account" %}game account{% /term %} that uses one. A ban is the game's decision, and GGE Command cannot lift it.

You choose to use GGE Command, and you take the risk of a ban. [Playing it safe](/playing-it-safe/) explains the risk and the habits that keep you in control.

## Provided as is {% #as-is %}

GGE Command is provided as is. We work to keep it running, but we cannot promise that every {% term id="module" %}module{% /term %} works all the time.

- The game changes. An update to the game can stop a module from working until we fix it.
- Modules can change. We add, change and remove modules and settings over time.
- The bot can make mistakes. It can send an attack or an order you did not expect, so check your settings and read the [Logs page](/war-room/logs/).

## No Goodgame art {% #no-game-art %}

GGE Command and these docs use no art, logos or screenshots from the game. The pictures come from our own app and from the icons on game-icons.net, used under the CC BY 3.0 licence. The [credits](/credits/) page names every artist.

## Questions {% #questions %}

If something on this page is unclear, [contact us](/contact/).
